tions, wage war across the land, conquer enemy territories, and strive to become the most powerful knight on the continent of Eusia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353130/extras/ff57b135c991db0efc47bc5d78bab519.poster.avif?t=1765708727\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353130/extras/ff57b135c991db0efc47bc5d78bab519.webm?t=1765708727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353130/extras/ff57b135c991db0efc47bc5d78bab519.mp4?t=1765708727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features approximately 27 main storyline battles, as well as several side missions, each filled with challenges and strategic depth. You’ll break through fog-covered forests, endure battles in torrential rain, fight against the cold in snow-covered plateaus, push forward through lava-filled underworlds, or outmaneuver your enemies in endless deserts. Each level incorporates unique strategic elements, testing your wisdom and tactics, offering an unparalleled strategic experience. Embark on this grand adventure and conquer every battlefield across the continent of Eusia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353130/extras/688586898194d924b589eda796612462.poster.avif?t=1765708727\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353130/extras/688586898194d924b589eda796612462.webm?t=1765708727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353130/extras/688586898194d924b589eda796612462.mp4?t